# `segno-ui.pen` is an ENCRYPTED design file. Without this, git treats it as
# text: every design edit renders as thousands of changed lines (67% of the
# Loop slice diff was this one file), and — far worse — a merge or rebase
# will attempt a LINE-WISE merge of ciphertext and produce a file that
# decrypts to nothing. `binary` is `-diff -merge -text`, so git refuses the
# text merge and asks for a real resolution instead.
*.pen binary

# Goldens are compared byte-for-byte by the screenshot suite; never let a
# checkout rewrite their line endings.
*.png binary
